# API / engine

- FastAPI + SQLite WAL under `data/` (gitignored).
- Connectors: `engine/connectors/ollama.py`, `openclaw.py`.
- Muse: `engine/muse.py` — Ollama-first.
- Project Committer cwd is always `projects/<slug>`.
- Delete only when archived + typed name match.
- Never write story content into the app git index.